Tier 0: Critical Raw Materials & Mineral Extraction
The foundation of the supply chain requires absolute domestic sourcing of foundational elements to eliminate single-point geopolitical vulnerabilities.


* Rare Earth Elements (REEs): Extraction and processing of Neodymium, Dysprosium, and Samarium for permanent magnet servo actuators, gimbal drives, and microwave radar circulators. Primary domestic sourcing anchored at Mountain Pass, CA, with downstream chemical separation executed at dedicated domestic processing hubs.
* Advanced Semiconductors & Substrates: Production of high-purity Gallium Nitride (GaN) grown on Silicon Carbide (SiC) substrates for Active Electronically Scanned Array (AESA) radar transmit/receive (T/R) modules. Fabrication of radiation-hardened Silicon-on-Insulator (SOI) wafers tailored for orbital Space Based Infrared System (SBIRS) and Defense Support Program (DSP) focal plane arrays.
* Structural & Aerodynamic Alloys: Mining and refining of Aerospace-grade Titanium (Ti-6Al-4V) for interceptor airframe structures and high-temperature nozzle throats; Ultra-High Strength Steels (AerMet 100, 300M) for high-pressure rocket motor cases; and High-Purity Aluminum-Lithium (Al-Li 2195) for lightweight launcher canisters and tactical UAV frames.
* Energetics & Thermal Protection: Domestic synthesis of Hydroxyl-Terminated Polybutadiene (HTPB) binder, Ammonium Perchlorate (AP) oxidizer, nano-aluminum fuel powder, and Carbon-Carbon (C-C) composite matrix structures engineered for exoatmospheric kill vehicle thermal protection and hypersonic re-entry stability.


