Tier 1: Primary Processing & Component Fabrication
Raw minerals are converted into specialized, defense-grade components within secure domestic facilities.


* Microelectronics Foundry Operations: Utilization of secure domestic sub-7nm foundries for high-performance Battle Management System (BMS) neural inference processors, alongside trusted legacy 28nm/65nm radiation-hardened lines for Link-16/IBCS cryptographic security chips and seeker Digital Signal Processing (DSP) units.
* Solid Rocket Motor (SRM) Casting: Precision robotic vacuum mixing, mandrel casting, and automated non-destructive ultrasonic inspection of solid propellant grains for Tamir, PAC-3 MSE, THAAD, and GBI boosters.
* Sensor & Optics Fabrication: Fabrication of cryogenically cooled mid-wave infrared (MWIR) and long-wave infrared (LWIR) focal plane arrays, synthetic sapphire radomes, and conformal electro-optical/infrared (EO/IR) sensor suites.
* Structural Hardware & Fasteners: Precision machining of Mil-Spec NAS/MS high-strength aerospace fasteners, titanium structural bolts, and specialized fluorosilicone O-ring sealing assemblies rated for continuous operations under extreme environmental conditions (-50°C to +60°C).


