Radar Subsystems
Fabrication and alignment of AN/FPS-132 Upgraded Early Warning Radars (UEWR), AN/MPQ-65/GhostEye AESA arrays, and EL/M-2084 Multi-Mission Radar (MMR) panels. Integration includes direct mounting of GaN T/R modules, closed-loop liquid cooling chiller units, and digital beamforming processors.
Battle Management Systems (BMS)
Assembly of ruggedized tactical command consoles, multi-touch operator workstations, dual-redundant mil-spec rack servers, High-Altitude Electromagnetic Pulse (HEMP)-hardened tactical shelter enclosures, and uninterruptible power supply (UPS) battery banks.
Kinetic Interceptor Assemblies
Final integration of Tamir, PAC-3 MSE, THAAD, and Ground-Based Interceptors (GBI). Processes include precision mounting of infrared/radar guidance seeker sections, Ring Laser Gyroscope (RLG) inertial measurement units, Divert and Attitude Control Systems (DACS), and hit-to-kill kinetic warhead assemblies.
Mobile & Fixed Launch Units
Construction of 20-canister Tamir vertical launch modules, Patriot M903 trailer-mounted launcher assemblies, THAAD truck-mounted transport-erector-launchers (TEL), and GBI underground silo liner structures.


