Geographical Site Distribution
Placement of coastal forward-surveillance radar perimeters, dedicated point-defense shields around critical national infrastructure (power grids, government centers, logistics hubs), and strategic interior deep-silo installations for homeland exoatmospheric interceptors.
Civil Works & Facility Hardening
Site excavation and pouring of reinforced concrete foundations rated for 5,000+ PSI compressive strength. Installation of integrated blast deflectors, subterranean structural cable vaults, and perimeter physical intrusion detection systems (PIDS).
Final Mechanical & Electrical Bolting
Securing launch assets using heavy-duty Grade 8 anchor bolts torqued to exact structural engineer specifications. Mounting onto seismic isolation spring dampeners, establishing copper ground-grid networks maintaining under 5 Ohms impedance, and completing certified Faraday cage enclosure validation.


