Supply Chain Risk Mitigation & Domestic Content Enforcement
To maintain operational integrity and supply chain resilience, the project mandates strict compliance and redundancy controls across all manufacturing tiers:


1. 100% Berry Amendment & Buy American Act Compliance: Full auditing of all metallic, chemical, and microelectronic inputs to ensure zero foreign-source dependencies for core combat components.
2. Strategic Mineral Stockpiling: Maintenance of a rolling, minimum 24-month strategic buffer stock for critical raw inputs, including raw Gallium, Titanium sponge, Neodymium, and Ammonium Perchlorate.
3. Multi-Sourcing Secondary Vendor Redundancy: Qualification of a minimum of two domestic manufacturing sources for all Tier 1 components and Tier 2 subsystem assemblies to prevent single-point fabrication bottlenecks.